# Trivy ignore file used by both the SCA (filesystem) and image scans.
#
# Format: one vulnerability ID per line, optionally with an expiry date, e.g.
#   CVE-2024-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Policy: only add an entry after reviewing the finding, with a comment that
# explains why it does not apply and who accepted the risk. The list is empty
# on purpose: the current build has no accepted HIGH/CRITICAL exceptions.
